# W3b Wayland app-frame receipt. `CAMBIUM_HOST_FRAME_TRACE=1` records winit's
# post-configure decoration answer beside these app-authored pixels.

log W3b app frame: app content opened with exactly one product title bar
assert snap window_frame == app
assert text host smoke
assert text cambium-genet-winit-host smoke
capture opened

click role:button clicked
settle 1
assert event clicks 1
capture busy

resize 560 400
settle 4
capture resized
assert text cambium-genet-winit-host smoke
log W3b app frame: product title bar captured and app remained app-framed
